OL,3,GNEWSAAI spots nearly 19,000 'shocking'
OL,4,Aroad offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artificial intelligence trial
OL,7,Fidentified almost 19,000 potential
OL,8,Fdriving offences in Birmingham and
OL,9,FWolverhampton in just two weeks.
OL,11,FWest Midlands mayor Richard Parker
OL,12,Fcalled the findings "shocking" saying
OL,13,Fthe number of drivers putting
OL,14,Fthemselves and others at risk was "far
OL,15,Fhigher than we expected".
OL,17,FThe trial used AI-powered cameras
OL,18,Foutside Ladywood and Fallings Park fire
OL,19,Fstations in March to identify potential
OL,20,Fseatbelt and mobile phone offences.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
