OL,3,GNEWSAAI spots nearly 19,000 'shocking'
OL,4,Aroad offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe images they captured included a
OL,7,Ffront-seat passenger holding a small
OL,8,Fchild on their lap without a seatbelt
OL,9,Fand a driver holding a mobile phone
OL,10,Fwith both hands.
